### E. Exploration priorities — REVISE

1. **[MAJOR] [exploration_rounds:33](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/ref_papers/exploration_rounds.md:33)** “GP-Hedge-over-8-actions, updated by terminal gain” is not a defined GP-Hedge baseline here: the menu includes stop and refit actions, terminal feedback is delayed and observed only for the chosen trajectory, and GP-Hedge’s full-information posterior-mean reward applies to acquisition nominees. **Fix:** Make accurate GP-Hedge scoping P0; specify a comparable acquisition-only baseline or a separately named, fully specified strategy-level bandit before requiring an experiment. [GP-Hedge algorithm](https://mwhoffman.com/papers/hoffman_2011.pdf).

